Package: convertxlsform
Type: Package
Title: Convert an XLSForm to a Word Document
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Masud", "Rahman", email = "write2masud+convertxlsform@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts XLSForm questionnaires, as used by Open Data Kit (ODK) and
    KoboToolbox, into formatted Microsoft Word documents for paper-based
    interviewing and review. Supports multilingual forms, nested question
    numbering, skip logic display, and question and choice media.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/masud90/convertxlsform
BugReports: https://github.com/masud90/convertxlsform/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    magrittr,
    optparse,
    purrr,
    readxl,
    rlang,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
